File Index

/affect-echo.plugin.ts
Purpose: Echoes affect gains and losses to the terminal with configurable colors.

/brew.plugin.ts
Purpose: This plugin enables users to define and execute custom item brewing recipes with letter mappings, symbol shortcuts, and persistent storage.

/colorkit.plugin.ts
Purpose: Colorize log lines based on configurable rules without trigger scripts.

/disarm.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automatically re-wields disarmed weapons by mapping item names to aliases.

/enchant.plugin.ts
Purpose: Enchant Helper plugin automates item enchanting with configurable item lists and spell casting.

/gourd.plugin.ts
Purpose: Tracks and manages potion gourd inventory with scan, quaff, and drop commands.

/highlighter.plugin.ts
Purpose: Highlights player names in chat logs by organization color based on configurable regex rules.

/people.plugin.ts
Purpose: Parses player data from game commands into a shared database for tracking and annotation.

/peopleDb.ts
Purpose: Manages persistent storage and retrieval of character data for the game client.

/questbot-stats-idb.ts
Purpose: IndexedDB storage for QuestBot statistics with running aggregates and session management.

/questbot.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automates DSL questing cycles with stats tracking and command interfaces.

/respell.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automatically recasts spells when they drop based on user-defined mappings.

/roller.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automatically accepts or rejects stat rolls based on configurable thresholds and prompts.

/standup.plugin.ts
Purpose: Enables automatic standing up in game when specific knockdown phrases are detected.

/warlock-alphabet.plugin.ts
Purpose: This plugin helps warlocks manage spell recipes by tracking item assignments to brew letters and automating correct insertion order.
